{"id":"9696d415dc9fbca150d398a88eb6b9bb1e18cebb","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236783","title":"最近 claude 表现如何？有必要从 codex 转过去吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"sudoy","excerpt":"问与答 - @sudoy - 之前一直用 Claude ，7 月份有个大型项目完工以后就停止 claude max 订阅了，7 月中旬以后一直用 codex 做别的开发，感觉体验还不错。最近那个大型项目想继续开发，担心 codex","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/sudoy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4964/914e/412163_large.png?m=1667207619\" alt=\"sudoy\" data-uid=\"412163\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/sudoy\">sudoy</a> · <span title=\"2026-08-24 13:47:18 +08:00\">23h 25m ago</span> · 920 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>之前一直用 Claude ，7 月份有个大型项目完工以后就停止 claude max 订阅了，7 月中旬以后一直用 codex 做别的开发，感觉体验还不错。最近那个大型项目想继续开发，担心 codex 搞不定，想重新订阅 claude ，想请问下大佬们最近 claude 表现怎么样？有没有必要订阅回去？还是直接上 codex</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010455\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b58f/4505/570178_normal.png?m=1772093736\" alt=\"tsja\" data-uid=\"570178\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tsja\">tsja</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:49:42 +08:00\">23h 23m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>一直双持，不过都是 20 刀的基础订阅版，一直感觉 claude 比 codex 靠谱 稳重很多，之前 codex 经常重置量大管饱算有点，现在额度也变少了，更倾向 claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010478\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4a0/452d/556606_normal.png?m=1784530402\" alt=\"Julaoshi\" data-uid=\"556606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Julaoshi\">Julaoshi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:52:49 +08:00\">23h 19m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我也双持 都是 20 美元套餐 我感觉 Claude 更耐用 基本上都能用上五六天 效果也更好 codex 减量很严重 算上重置也不太行<br>我用 Claude 制定任务书 codex 实施后 Claude 再复核并改进 效果还不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010502\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4249e407b17a518d467a1e17cf22cfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zuosiruan\" data-uid=\"204104\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zuosiruan\">zuosiruan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:56:09 +08:00\">23h 16m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/tsja\">tsja</a> claude 目前是活动期双倍额度，还有几天</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010510\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4964/914e/412163_normal.png?m=1667207619\" alt=\"sudoy\" data-uid=\"412163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sudoy\">sudoy</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:57:17 +08:00\">23h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/tsja\">tsja</a> 感谢回复！我之前 claude 20 刀用一两天就没了，所以我今年 1 到 7 月都是 100 刀套餐，现在是不是 20 刀比以前耐用了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010518\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4964/914e/412163_normal.png?m=1667207619\" alt=\"sudoy\" data-uid=\"412163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sudoy\">sudoy</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:58:20 +08:00\">23h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Julaoshi\">Julaoshi</a> 感谢回复！我想试试 claude 20 刀看看是不是比以前耐用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014235\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4964/914e/412163_normal.png?m=1667207619\" alt=\"sudoy\" data-uid=\"412163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sudoy\">sudoy</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 10:41:08 +08:00\">2h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a> 我订阅没被封过，今年 1 刀 6 月份都是订 max ，主要是太贵了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"sudoy · 23h 25m ago · 920 views 之前一直用 Claude ，7 月份有个大型项目完工以后就停止 claude max 订阅了，7 月中旬以后一直用 codex 做别的开发，感觉体验还不错。最近那个大型项目想继续开发，担心 codex 搞不定，想重新订阅 claude ，想请问下大佬们最近 claude 表现怎么样？有没有必要订阅回去？还是直接上 codex 1 tsja 23h 23m ago 1 一直双持，不过都是 20 刀的基础订阅版，一直感觉 claude 比 codex 靠谱 稳重很多，之前 codex 经常重置量大管饱算有点，现在额度也变少了，更倾向 claude 2 Julaoshi 23h 19m ago 1 我也双持 都是 20 美元套餐 我感觉 Claude 更耐用 基本上都能用上五六天 效果也更好 codex 减量很严重 算上重置也不太行我用 Claude 制定任务书 codex 实施后 Claude 再复核并改进 效果还不错 3 zuosiruan 23h 16m ago via iPhone 1 @tsja claude 目前是活动期双倍额度，还有几天 4 sudoy OP 23h 15m ago @tsja 感谢回复！我之前 claude 20 刀用一两天就没了，所以我今年 1 到 7 月都是 100 刀套餐，现在是不是 20 刀比以前耐用了？ 5 sudoy OP 23h 14m ago @Julaoshi 感谢回复！我想试试 claude 20 刀看看是不是比以前耐用了 14 sudoy OP 2h 31m ago @wzw 我订阅没被封过，今年 1 刀 6 月份都是订 max ，主要是太贵了","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T05:12:48.693Z","ok":true}